        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is provided for household goods on this intercity move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We offer 100 % declared‑value, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering loss, theft, or damage during the Patna‑to‑Saharanpur journey. The policy is automatically applied to all items, and a detailed claim form is supplied should any incident occur, making the process hassle‑free.</p>
